<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFrameworks>net8.0;net9.0;net10.0</TargetFrameworks>
    <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
    <LangVersion>latest</LangVersion>
    <Version>3.0.1</Version>
    <Authors>Ahmad Omar Al-Freihat</Authors>
    <Description>Proof-carrying collections for .NET. NonEmptyList&lt;T&gt; is a list the type system guarantees has at least one element, with collection expressions, list patterns, type-preserving LINQ, generic math, query-string binding, error-accumulating Validation, constraint types (AtLeast, Distinct, Sorted), NonEmptySet, NonEmptyDictionary, NonEmptyString, zipper, event stream, rose tree, non-empty async batching, and a bundled Roslyn analyzer and source generator.</Description>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/a7mdfre7at/Masterly.NonEmptyList</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/a7mdfre7at/Masterly.NonEmptyList</RepositoryUrl>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.nuget.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
    <PackageTags>NonEmptyList;non-empty-list;NonEmpty;List;Collection;ImmutableList;FunctionalProgramming;FP;CSharp;DotNet;Scala;TypeSafe;NullSafety;Head;Tail;Map;FlatMap;Reduce;Fold;LINQ;Enumerable;Validation;Analyzer;SourceGenerator;NonEmptySet;NonEmptyString</PackageTags>
    <PackageIcon>repo_image.png</PackageIcon>
    <PackageLicenseFile>LICENSE.txt</PackageLicenseFile>
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>
v3.0.1:
- New package icon: a pair of brackets around a single element

v3.0.0:
- BREAKING: NonEmptyList&lt;T&gt; no longer inherits List&lt;T&gt;. It wraps its storage, so the non-empty guarantee now holds through IList&lt;T&gt;, ICollection&lt;T&gt; and IList as well
- BREAKING: Prepend(item) now returns a new list (LINQ semantics); use AddFirst(item) to insert in place
- BREAKING: Remove(item) returns bool like List&lt;T&gt;; AsReadOnly returns ReadOnlyCollection&lt;T&gt;
- BREAKING: Dropped .NET 6 target; now targets .NET 8, 9 and 10
- Collection expressions: NonEmptyList&lt;int&gt; xs = [1, 2, 3]; (also ImmutableNonEmptyList, ConstrainedList, NonEmptySet)
- List patterns and range slicing: xs is [var head, .. var rest], xs[1..]
- Type-preserving LINQ: Select, SelectMany, OrderBy/ThenBy, GroupBy, Distinct, Union, Concat, Chunk, Min, Max stay non-empty; query syntax supported
- Generic math: Sum, Product, Average, Median, Mode, MinMax with no empty-sequence exception path
- ISpanParsable / TypeConverter: bind NonEmptyList&lt;T&gt; and NonEmptyString directly from query strings, route values and configuration
- Validation&lt;T, TError&gt;: error-accumulating validation whose error list is non-empty by construction
- Constraint algebra: ConstrainedList&lt;T, AtLeast&lt;Two&gt;&gt;, Distinct, Sorted, AtMost, Exactly, And, Or; Second()/Third() only when the type proves them
- New types: NonEmptySet, NonEmptyDictionary, NonEmptyString, NonEmptySpan, NonEmptyZipper, History, EventStream, NonEmptyTree, NonEmptyEnumerable (lazy, infinite)
- Async batching: BatchNonEmpty (size and time based), ReadAllBatchesAsync for channels, ToNonEmptyAsync / NonEmptyAsyncEnumerable
- Bundled Roslyn analyzers (NEL001-NEL005) with code fixes, and the [NonEmptyCollection] source generator for domain collections
- Protected invariant hooks (EnsureMutable, ValidateItem, ValidateRange, ValidateReplacement, ValidateCount) for derived types
- New factories: NonEmptyList.Of, Create, Range, Iterate, Unfold; FromSpan; params ReadOnlySpan constructors; IEnumerable constructors
- New operators: Scan, Tails, Inits, Append, Flatten, Unzip, Interleave, Cycle, ConvertAll
- [NotNullWhen(true)] on TryFrom; DebuggerDisplay and debugger type proxy; O(n) MinBy/MaxBy
    </PackageReleaseNotes>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <!-- The analyzers, code fixes and the [NonEmptyCollection] source generator ship inside this package. -->
  <ItemGroup>
    <ProjectReference Include="../Masterly.NonEmptyList.Analyzers/Masterly.NonEmptyList.Analyzers.csproj" ReferenceOutputAssembly="false" OutputItemType="Analyzer" PrivateAssets="all" />
    <ProjectReference Include="../Masterly.NonEmptyList.Analyzers.CodeFixes/Masterly.NonEmptyList.Analyzers.CodeFixes.csproj" ReferenceOutputAssembly="false" OutputItemType="Analyzer" PrivateAssets="all" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="../Masterly.NonEmptyList.Analyzers/bin/$(Configuration)/netstandard2.0/Masterly.NonEmptyList.Analyzers.dll" Pack="true" PackagePath="analyzers/dotnet/cs" Visible="false" />
    <None Include="../Masterly.NonEmptyList.Analyzers.CodeFixes/bin/$(Configuration)/netstandard2.0/Masterly.NonEmptyList.Analyzers.CodeFixes.dll" Pack="true" PackagePath="analyzers/dotnet/cs" Visible="false" />
  </ItemGroup>

